  <section class="row" id="windshield" aria-labelledby="windshield-title">
    <h2 id="windshield-title">Windshield replacement</h2>
    <div class="row-body">
      <p>Your windshield is a safety component, not just a piece of glass. It supports the roof in a rollover, helps your airbags deploy correctly, and keeps you protected from the road.</p>
      <p>When a crack spreads across your field of view, reaches the edge of the glass, or is simply too large to repair, replacement is the safe choice. We install quality glass, use proper urethane and curing procedures, and make sure everything seals and fits the way it should.</p>
      <p>Because we're mobile, we can replace your windshield in your driveway or your work parking lot. No dropping the car off, no borrowing a ride, no wasted afternoon.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/#quote">Get a windshield quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row" id="chip-repair" aria-labelledby="chip-title">
    <h2 id="chip-title">Windshield repair (chips and cracks)</h2>
    <div class="row-body">
      <p>Caught the damage early? Don't wait. A small chip or short crack can often be repaired in minutes, and a good repair stops the damage from spreading into a crack that forces a full replacement.</p>
      <p>Repair is faster, more affordable, and in many cases saves your original factory windshield (which also means no ADAS calibration needed). The sooner you call, the better your odds of a clean repair.</p>
      <p>A good rule of thumb: if the chip is smaller than a quarter and not directly in your line of sight, it's often a repair candidate. We'll tell you honestly whether a repair will hold or whether replacement is the smarter call.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/#quote">Ask about a repair</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/windshield-repair/">More about windshield repair</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row row-dark" id="adas" aria-labelledby="adas-title">
    <h2 id="adas-title">In-house ADAS calibration</h2>
    <div class="row-body">
      <p>This is where a lot of auto glass jobs go wrong, and where we stand out.</p>
      <p>Most vehicles built in the last several years have ADAS (Advanced Driver Assistance Systems): lane departure warning, automatic emergency braking, adaptive cruise control, and more. These systems rely on a forward-facing camera mounted at the top of your windshield. When the windshield is replaced, that camera almost always has to be recalibrated so it aims exactly where the manufacturer intended.</p>
      <p>Skip the calibration, or do it wrong, and those safety systems can misfire or fail when you need them most.</p>
      <p>Here's the Fresh Start difference: we do ADAS calibration in-house, on our own equipment, in the same visit as your glass work. We don't replace your glass and then send you to a dealership to finish the job.</p>
      <ul class="why-list">
        <li><strong>One appointment, not two.</strong> Glass and calibration, start to finish.</li>
        <li><strong>Documented pre- and post-scans.</strong> You get proof the systems were checked before and verified after.</li>
        <li><strong>Done correctly.</strong> Calibrated to manufacturer specifications so your safety features work the way they're supposed to.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If your vehicle needs calibration, we'll tell you up front and build it into your quote. No surprises, no runaround.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact/#quote">Ask if your vehicle needs calibration</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row" id="door-glass" aria-labelledby="door-title">
    <h2 id="door-title">Door and side glass replacement</h2>
    <div class="row-body">
      <p>A broken door window from a break-in or accident leaves your vehicle exposed to weather and theft. We replace door and side glass quickly, and we clean up the broken glass that scatters into the door and seats, because a half-finished job isn't a finished job. Call as soon as it happens and we'll get you buttoned up and secure again.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/#quote">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row" id="back-glass" aria-labelledby="back-title">
    <h2 id="back-title">Back glass (rear windshield) replacement</h2>
    <div class="row-body">
      <p>Rear glass shatters into hundreds of pieces, and it often takes the defroster grid with it. We replace back glass, reconnect defroster and antenna connections where applicable, and vacuum out the debris so your cargo area and back seat are clean.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/#quote">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row" id="mirror-glass" aria-labelledby="mirror-title">
    <h2 id="mirror-title">Side mirror glass replacement</h2>
    <div class="row-body">
      <p>A cracked or missing mirror isn't just annoying, it's a blind spot and a potential ticket. We replace side mirror glass affordably, including heated and convex mirror glass on many models.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/#quote">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>
